"""Long-form article — Best Trailer Hitches for 2020–2025 Kia Telluride (1st gen).
Mirrors the approved pilot (ford_f150_2021_tonneau.py). No invented hands-on testing: hitch ratings from CURT and
Draw-Tite product pages, harness fitment from CURT, Telluride tow figures from Kia dealer/reference pages and owner
reports on kiatelluride.org / tellurideforum.org (all in SOURCES, checked 2026-09-24). Amazon picks by listing title.
Angle: the Telluride is one of the few mid-size SUVs where the hitch, not the vehicle, can be the limit (X-Pro 5,500 lb
vs 5,000 lb hitches), plus the OEM-vs-aftermarket choice and the 2023 wiring split.
Kia skipped MY2026; the next generation is the 2027 Telluride. DB gen slug stays "2020-present".
"""

